Since he was chaotic, the only quest artifacts he could wish for were
Longbow of Diana and Master Key. Master Key gives tele control, half
damage and warning. The first two are pretty high up on my list. I'd
pick the Key over a weapon because the Key and a +7 whatever is better
than no Key and a +7 ArtifactWeapon.

As for picking Grayswandir over Frost Brand, I have heard people
complain about Frost Brand breaking potions. Also, it seems like most
of the tougher monsters you face are hurt by silver. Skilled in long
sword (Frost Brand) vs. basic in saber (Grayswandir) doesn't seem like
that big of a difference.


